{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/bf3c5e1ba4962aad91e3933c371aa4ee.poster.avif?t=1771163875\" width=1024 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/bf3c5e1ba4962aad91e3933c371aa4ee.webm?t=1771163875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/bf3c5e1ba4962aad91e3933c371aa4ee.mp4?t=1771163875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DOOM SPIRAL</strong> is a psychotic first-person shooter where your sanity is the only health bar that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/cfcc7d2d98af048b7d89fac9983e9cdd.poster.avif?t=1771163875\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/cfcc7d2d98af048b7d89fac9983e9cdd.webm?t=1771163875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/cfcc7d2d98af048b7d89fac9983e9cdd.mp4?t=1771163875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[STORY]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You jacked into\u00a0their mainframe looking for dirt, but they were waiting.\u00a0Now your psyche is trapped in their wires while your meat-body is flatlining in a basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way up through the nightmare spiral labyrinth tower, battling <strong>VOID GHOSTS</strong> and trying to stay <strong>SANE</strong>. Each death sends you back down into the ((((( O ))))). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/184f6ff7e06db0a014595d472c152399.poster.avif?t=1771163875\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/184f6ff7e06db0a014595d472c152399.webm?t=1771163875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/184f6ff7e06db0a014595d472c152399.mp4?t=1771163875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[WHAT MAKES DOOM SPIRAL DIFFERENT]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique shooting mechanics</strong> - you shoot with each hand independently\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your sanity is your healthbar\u00a0</strong>- the level around you is continuously disintegrating. You have to keep moving to stay alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super graphics and\u00a0sounds</strong> - you've never seen or heard\u00a0anything like this</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore difficulty\u00a0</strong>- you're seriously awesome if you can finish this game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/0bddf3236d888f3d230b4e61bfc1fd9b.poster.avif?t=1771163875\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458890/extras/0bddf3236d888f3d230b4e61bfc1fd9b.webm?t=1771163875\" type=\"video/